- How would you monitor and test this end-to-end in a CI/CD pipeline?

## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical Azure ML routing, per-tenant isolation, and real-world deployment controls for AI services.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant-aware routing and dynamic model versioning
- Canary rollouts, rollback safety, and traffic splitting
- Data isolation via per-tenant storage and Key Vault
- Auditing with Microsoft Purview and synthetic tests
- Latency optimization through regional endpoint caching

## Code Example
```javascript
